        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Would you be able to walk around a bit with me, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'm a little worried about you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, did you know? When I was a child, this beach wasn't this busy. I used to like making sand castles by myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This city is getting better and better every year, thanks to my father.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "My father and I, well, don't talk a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've always wondered... Which is more important, this city and the wealth it brings, or me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "My mother died when she gave birth to me. Sometimes I think about if that's the reason why he doesn't like me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it feels like he doesn't care if I like him or not. Ever since I can remember, he has rarely been at home because of business. Rather than father and daughter, we're more like two strangers living under the same roof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_hotel",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Schwarz, I want to go observe the ecosystem of the beach!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mustn't, milady. Master Doykos said you must not go outside without good reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#1",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm tired of reading the same old books here! Schwarz, you're no fun at all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#1",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My apologies, milady. This is for your safety though; it's dangerous outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But won't you be with me? Are you going to put me in danger?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Of course I wouldn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, what's the problem then? Let's go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...In that case, please do not stray from my sight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_sunnytown_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "One could say that back then, having Schwarz at my side just felt like a simple fact of life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "B",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_sunnytown_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up, these ornaments are for tonight's concert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Civilian"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be in trouble if we don't make it on time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Civilian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I remember properly, he's the grandson of the owner of the Mockingbird Caf\u00e9 on Second Avenue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I used to go there a lot. The old storekeeper was a kind man. His wife had already passed away at that time, so he decorated the caf\u00e9 with her favorite flowers and bonsai trees, and put on their favorite music.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "But he did say that he was getting too old to run the shop, and would pass the business over to his grandson.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Time sure flies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_hotel",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I have Oripathy, milady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's bad for your health to come too close to me. Please call upon me only when it is necessary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that? Does it hurt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...It doesn't hurt, but, I will die because of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no cure for this disease, milady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "And...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just have to find the cure then!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, just you wait! One day, I'll defeat that illness, and snatch you back from its jaws!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_sunnytown_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "The reason I became an Originium researcher was because of her. I wanted to cure her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "That has always been the thing motivating me. I even went to Victoria to pursue this dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, Originium research is very difficult. At the beginning, I couldn't even grasp the basic concepts and felt like giving up. But I persevered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria is also very far away, and I couldn't get used to it at first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg",
        "imagegroup": "bg_beach_1/bg_beach_2",
        "solidwidth": "920/920",
        "solidheight": 720,
        "x": -180
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, I feel like I'm more of a Victorian than a Siestan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, could it be said that everything I have is an illusion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg",
        "imagegroup": "bg_beach_1/bg_beach_2",
        "solidwidth": "920/920",
        "solidheight": 720,
        "x": -180
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm willing to pay anything to protect this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg",
        "imagegroup": "bg_beach_1/bg_beach_2",
        "solidwidth": "920/920",
        "solidheight": 720,
        "x": -180
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I don't know.;She might be struggling too.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... I suppose so. There's no way you'd be able to know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what is it? Something she can't even tell me about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, no matter what she's struggling with, that much is inevitable because of the sins she has committed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, do you think I should give up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I can't answer that for you...",
        "values": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "But you are a true Originium researcher.",
        "values": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we vanquish Oripathy?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we save the Infected?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will there be an end to these tribulations?"
    },
    {
        "text": "If there is, I can't see it. I'm not sure. I don't know how to answer."
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I just give up? Yes."
    },
    {
        "text": "But I don't want to."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg",
        "imagegroup": "bg_beach_1/bg_beach_2",
        "solidwidth": "920/920",
        "solidheight": 720,
        "x": -180
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Perhaps the land we've been born into is blighted...",
        "values": 5
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 5
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "But the things that you've done have not been in vain.",
        "values": 6
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 6
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Believe in the choices you've made.",
        "values": 7
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... You're right, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your experience really shows. Looks like I still have a lot to learn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, I need to stop being sentimental and start by finding the proof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they are really putting citizens in danger on purpose, I'll do everything in my power to stop them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I believe in my own decisions, I'll fight to save this city, even if nobody else will!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1#2",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1#2",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Mister Hellagur!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1#2",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "By the looks of things, you've found your answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1#2",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm. Mister Hellagur, Doctor, could you hear me out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what, I don't want to see the citizens being put into danger. That's my number one priority. The largest broadcast tower here is located by the Garrison Amusement Park.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "It controls this city's entire broadcast system.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1#3",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The broadcast tower?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1#3",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "However, it's controlled by Cronin's henchmen. He often appears there to speak to the citizens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
